{"id":"conclusion","lemma":"conclusion","pos":"noun","rank":3126,"glosses":["conclusion"],"ipa":"/kɔ̃.kly.zjɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/dd/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-conclusion.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-conclusion.wav.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"conclusions"},"formAudio":{"conclusions":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e5/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-conclusions.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"La conclusion est limpide.","en":"The conclusion is crystal clear.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"clear, limpid"}]},{"text":"Je suis arrivée à la même conclusion.","en":"I've come to the same conclusion.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"arrival"},null,null,{"g":"same"},null],"phrases":[[3,5,"a la"]]},{"text":"Je n'ai tiré aucune conclusion.","en":"I haven't reached any conclusions.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to draw, drag, pull","l":"tirer"},{"g":"none, no-one","l":"aucun"},null]},{"text":"Comment en es-tu arrivé à cette conclusion ?","en":"How did you come to that conclusion?","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"are","l":"être"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to arrive","l":"arriver"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null]},{"text":"Nous ne sommes parvenus à aucune conclusion.","en":"We didn't reach any conclusions.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/334595","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"parvenu","l":"parvenu"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"none, no-one","l":"aucun"},null]}]}